From: Paul Elder <paul.elder@ideasonboard.com>
Subject: [PATCH] media: shared media graph API for rkcif/rkisp2

RFC series rebased onto linux-stable v7.2.6 + rkisp2 v3:
https://lore.kernel.org/linux-rockchip/20260619052637.1110672-1-paul.elder@ideasonboard.com/

The original series used a typo (devv_dbg) that does not compile; this
copy uses dev_vdbg.

